## ✅ Acceptance Criteria Review

### US-015: Report Listing

**Acceptance Criteria:**

▪ Users can report suspicious or inappropriate clothing listings  
▪ Users can select or enter a reason for reporting  
▪ Submitted reports are connected to the correct clothing listing  
▪ Report information is saved correctly for administrator review  

**PO Decision:** ✅ Accepted

---

### US-016: Review Reports

**Acceptance Criteria:**

▪ Administrators can view submitted reports  
▪ Report information and reasons are displayed correctly  
▪ Administrators can inspect the related clothing listings  
▪ Administrators can remove inappropriate content when necessary  

**PO Decision:** ✅ Accepted

---

### US-017: Manage Users

**Acceptance Criteria:**

▪ Administrators can view registered user accounts  
▪ Administrators can access user management functions  
▪ Administrators can deactivate accounts that violate platform rules  
▪ Updated account status is saved correctly  

**PO Decision:** ✅ Accepted

---

### US-018: Monitor Listings

**Acceptance Criteria:**

▪ Administrators can view clothing listings  
▪ Listing information is displayed clearly  
▪ Available, Sold, and Removed statuses are displayed correctly  
▪ Administrators can monitor marketplace listings easily  

**PO Decision:** ✅ Accepted

---

### NFR-004: Administrator Access

**Acceptance Criteria:**

▪ Administrator functions are restricted to authorized administrators  
▪ Normal users cannot access administrator pages or functions  
▪ Administrator permissions are checked before management actions  
▪ Unauthorized access is prevented  

**PO Decision:** ✅ Accepted

