▪ Connecting submitted reports with the correct clothing listings  
▪ Organizing report information for administrator review  
▪ Integrating user account management functionality  
▪ Displaying listing statuses correctly in the administrator interface  
▪ Implementing administrator access restrictions  
▪ Ensuring administrative actions updated stored information correctly  

These issues were addressed through debugging, testing, and coordination between the developers.

No major unresolved blockers remained at the end of the Sprint.

